      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For this ultra-premium line, consider profiles like the \"Discerning Connoisseur,\" who values craftsmanship and rarity, often having moderate cultural capital. Another is the \"Global Tastemaker,\" who embraces international travel and sophisticated experiences, transcending single demographic boxes. Finally, the \"Established Achiever\" prioritizes timeless luxury and legacy, often gravitating towards heritage brands. Focusing on shared values—like curation, exclusivity, and personal narrative—will be more effective than targeting strict demographics.",
